14
00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:29.913
Absolutely.

15
00:00:29.913 --> 00:00:31.620
Happy Valentine's Day.

16
00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:32.700
Happy Valentine's Day. (chuckles)

17
00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:35.290
I love Valentine's day.

18
00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:36.123
Me too. (chuckles)

19
00:00:36.123 --> 00:00:38.804
Well, you've been married now for three years.

20
00:00:38.804 --> 00:00:40.810
Yep, almost. It'll be three in August.

21
00:00:40.810 --> 00:00:41.752
Three in August?

22
00:00:41.752 --> 00:00:42.750
Mm hmm.

23
00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:46.140
And will you tell us about your husband, Kevin?

24
00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:49.680
Yeah, so he's really funny.

25
00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:52.009 line:15%
I think that's kind of what attracted me to him,

26
00:00:52.009 --> 00:00:54.080 line:15%
like originally.

27
00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:58.330 line:15%
He's hard working. He's a great dad to our kids.

28
00:00:58.330 --> 00:01:01.670
Speaking of kids, your husband,

29
00:01:01.670 --> 00:01:06.650
