30
00:01:06.650 --> 00:01:07.483
Yes. (chuckles)

31
00:01:07.483 --> 00:01:09.050
Can you please tell me about that?

32
00:01:09.050 --> 00:01:13.500
So he was down on one knee and his daughter, Kaylee,

33
00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:17.510
was filming, and we were focusing on the moment.

34
00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:19.530
And then we kind of looked at each other

35
00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:20.780
because she started laughing,

36
00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:24.060
and we didn't know why she was laughing until he got up.

37
00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:27.680
And then we saw my son, Owen, who was at the time three,

38
00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:29.440
and he was peeing behind Kevin,

39
00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:31.470
and we had no idea.
(audience laughing)

40
00:01:31.470 --> 00:01:33.200
Isn't that just so life?

41
00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:34.033
Yes. (chuckles)

42
00:01:34.033 --> 00:01:35.240
Like it's so perfect.

43
00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:36.700
Also, you guys said you love to laugh,

44
00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:38.500
and humor is everything.

45
00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:39.333
Yep.

46
00:01:39.333 --> 00:01:41.160
