48
00:01:43.350 --> 00:01:44.183
Oh, okay.

49
00:01:44.183 --> 00:01:46.513
Well, actually we have a little surprise for you.

50
00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:52.170
Kevin actually wanted to do a little something

51
00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:54.720
