Oh, my God. (laughing)

57
00:02:09.272 --> 00:02:10.167
Am I getting up?

58
00:02:10.167 --> 00:02:11.737
(indistinct) right there.

59
00:02:11.737 --> 00:02:13.070
Oh, Okay.

60
00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:15.540
Ali, from our initial introduction,

61
