I knew you could be the one.

62
00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:19.925
From our first date to the Ferris wheel.

63
00:02:19.925 --> 00:02:21.730
(Alyssa laughing)

64
00:02:21.730 --> 00:02:23.777
No tickets necessary will always be part of our journey.

65
00:02:23.777 --> 00:02:25.420
(gentle harp music continues)

66
00:02:25.420 --> 00:02:28.110
Kaylee, Owen, Olivia, and I appreciate you

67
00:02:28.110 --> 00:02:29.977
