68
00:02:29.977 --> 00:02:30.820
(Alyssa inhales deeply)

69
00:02:30.820 --> 00:02:32.906
We may not show it all the time, but we do.

70
00:02:32.906 --> 00:02:36.400
(gentle harp music continues)

71
00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:37.346
I love you. (laughing)

72
00:02:37.346 --> 00:02:41.140
(gentle harp music continues)

73
00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:42.450
Ali.

74
00:02:42.450 --> 00:02:44.500
Oh! (gasps) Oh, okay.

75
00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:45.790
Will you marry me again?

76
00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:47.946
Yes. (laughing)

77
00:02:47.946 --> 00:02:50.381
(audience clapping)
(audience cheering)

78
